{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39990","headline":"寄卢端公同年仁烱时迁都洛阳新立幼主 · 徐夤","name":"寄卢端公同年仁烱时迁都洛阳新立幼主","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上阳宫阙翠华归，百辟伤心序汉仪。\n崑岳有炎琼玉碎，洛川无竹凤皇饥。\n须簪白笔匡明主，莫许黄㼐博少师。\n惆怅宸居远于日，长吁空摘鬓边丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}